Package: daiRH
Type: Package
Title: daiRH: An Agent Chat Panel Harness for RStudio (OpenAI-Compatible)
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("Shaoqing", "Dai",
    email = "shaoqing.dai@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0858-4728",
        URL = "http://gisersqdai.top/mycv/"))
Description: An RStudio addin that provides an LLM agent chat panel with a
    full harness layer. It can chat with an OpenAI-compatible LLM (Ollama,
    DeepSeek, GLM, Kimi, ...), read/edit project files, run R code safely in
    a callr subprocess, and fetch R documentation as tools. The harness adds
    a tool registry with user-defined tools and hooks, a hard per-turn tool
    budget, and jsonl call tracing, exposed through three frontends: a
    background chat panel, a classic gadget, and a console CLI.
